@startuml
title UC05 - View Daily Agenda (PetWise MVP)\nInfrastructure + Application + Domain

actor User as U  <<Attendant/Manager>>
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "AppointmentController\n(infrastructure)" as C
participant "ViewDailyAgendaUseCase\n(application)" as UC
participant "AppointmentGateway\n(port)" as GApp
participant "JpaAppointmentRepository\n(adapter)" as AApp
database "SQLite DB" as DB

== Happy Path: View Agenda ==

U -> UI : Open agenda screen
UI -> UI : Set default date = today\noptional filters: status, type

U -> UI : Select date/filters\nand click \"Search\"
UI -> C : GET /api/v1/appointments\n?date=YYYY-MM-DD&status=&type=&page=&size=
C -> UC : execute(query)

UC -> GApp : findByDateAndFilters(query)
GApp -> AApp : findByDateAndFilters(query)
AApp -> DB : SELECT * FROM appointment\nWHERE date(start_at) = ?\nAND type/status filters...
DB --> AApp : result set (0..n rows)
AApp --> GApp : list<Appointment>
GApp --> UC : list<Appointment>

UC --> C : Page<AppointmentSummaryResponse>
C --> UI : 200 OK\nJSON list

UI -> UI : Render agenda table/list

== Alternative: No Appointments ==

... same call path ...

DB --> AApp : empty result set
AApp --> GApp : empty list
GApp --> UC : empty list
UC --> C : empty page
C --> UI : 200 OK with empty list
UI -> UI : Show \"No appointments for this day\"

== Alternative: Invalid Date ==

U -> UI : Enter invalid date format
UI -> C : GET /api/v1/appointments?date=invalid
C -> UC : execute(query)
UC --> C : throws DomainException(Validation)
C -> "ApiExceptionHandler" as H : handle(DomainException)
H --> UI : 400 Bad Request\napplication/problem+json

@enduml
